WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.960
Native sign-in and audit
retention in Entra is 30 days,

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.537
so the logs stream to the workspace.

3
00:00:06.537 --> 00:00:08.012
Six signals matter.

4
00:00:08.012 --> 00:00:11.192
Provisioning logs for sync
live in the partner's tenant,

5
00:00:11.192 --> 00:00:13.312
so the agreement has to deliver them.

6
00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:16.118
On the agency side,
sync changes show up in

7
00:00:16.118 --> 00:00:18.924
the audit log under the sync fabric actor.

8
00:00:18.924 --> 00:00:24.100
Entitlement management records requests,
approvals, expiries and removals.

9
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.763
The sign-in log shows the MFA policy's

10
00:00:26.763 --> 00:00:30.313
failures and any denied
attempts after removal.

11
00:00:30.313 --> 00:00:32.929
Cross-tenant settings
changes are audited and

12
00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:35.412
alerted to the identity
governance officer.

13
00:00:35.412 --> 00:00:39.981
And drift compares the repository with
the tenant: a partner list mismatch,

14
00:00:39.981 --> 00:00:44.475
any non-guest without a record, or trust
values that differ from the record.

15
00:00:44.475 --> 00:00:49.299
The profile suggests four alerts: a
member partner account with no record,

16
00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:53.806
a sync cycle deleting more than
expected, and a partner list mismatch,

17
00:00:53.806 --> 00:00:58.370
all high; and a cross-tenant change
made outside a pull request, medium.
